+## Independent verification — 2026-10-24
+
+Revision checked: 4d043c04aebc762154ce3ef23c0ef67701e05bfa (working tree clean apart from untracked `.eval-runtime/`).
+Verifier: Claude (claude-opus-5-5), acting as independent verifier of the supplied composition; not the proof's author.
+Evidence kinds assessed: `claim` (imports of CLAIM-cache-append and CLAIM-cache-receipt), `code` (connecting step), executable witness `tests/witness_retry.py`.
