+### Inspected
+
+- [CLAIM-cache-once](../CLAIM-cache-once.md) statement and [proof.md](proof.md).
+- Imported records [CLAIM-cache-append](../CLAIM-cache-append.md) and [CLAIM-cache-receipt](../CLAIM-cache-receipt.md), their proofs, and their recorded `Result: pass` verdicts.
